      "description": "Partners | Career Services Skip to page content Skip to footer navigation Menu Request Info Visit Apply Give Resources for You Prospective Students Admitted Students Current Students Faculty and Staff Alumni and Friends Parents and Family Industry and Partners Tech Links A to Z Campus Directory Canvas Concur Email Experience Safety Data Sheets Website Settings Search Clear Search Input Search Category Michigan Tech This Site Programs Go Students Resumes and Letters Networking and Interviews Jobs | Co-ops | Internships Start Your Career Path On-Campus Jobs Career Fair Events Employers How to Hire Huskies Partner Program Current Employer Partners Career Fair Faculty/Staff Integrating Career in the Classroom Presentations On-Campus Jobs Career Champions Alumni Career Fair Events Connect Career Services Blog Staff Listing Data Portrait Lounge Search Clear Search Input Search Category Michigan Tech This Site Programs Search Students Resumes and Letters Networking and Interviews Jobs | Co-ops | Internships Start Your Career Path On-Campus Jobs Career Fair Events Employers How to Hire Huskies Partner Program Current Employer Partners Career Fair Faculty/Staff Integrating Career in the Classroom Presentations On-Campus Jobs Career Champions Alumni Career Fair Events Connect Career Services Blog Staff Listing Data Portrait Lounge Connect with Us Request Info Visit Apply Give Resources for You Prospective Students Admitted Students Current Students Faculty and Staff Alumni and Friends Parents and Family Industry and Partners Tech Links A to Z Campus Directory Canvas Concur Email Experience Safety Data Sheets Website Settings Career Services Career Services Employers Current Partners Also in this section Employers How to Hire Huskies Partner Program Current Employer Partners Career Fair Partners Offer financial support to University programs Sponsor on-campus events Participate in career education and development workshops on campus Serve on our advisory board Hire Michigan Tech Huskies! Platinum Partner Gold Partners Silver Partners Copper Partners Request Information Schedule a Visit Give Apply Admissions Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Global Campus Request Information Schedule a Visit Apply Virtual Tours Study and Live Academics Degrees / Majors Library Athletics Campus and Beyond Events Calendar Recreation Campus Info About Michigan Tech Accreditation Campus Map Jobs at Michigan Tech News Summer Youth Programs Webcams Policies and Safety Campus Safety Information Emergency Contact Information Report a Concern Public Safety / Police Services Student Disclosures Title IX University Policies Career Services Administration Building 220 1400 Townsend Drive Houghton, Michigan 49931 906-487-2313 906-487-3317 career@mtu.edu Instagram Linkedin Youtube Accessibility Equal Opportunity Email the Webmaster © 2026 Michigan Technological University ©"
