      "description": "Data | Career Services Skip to page content Skip to footer navigation Menu Request Info Visit Apply Give Resources for You Prospective Students Admitted Students Current Students Faculty and Staff Alumni and Friends Parents and Family Industry and Partners Tech Links A to Z Campus Directory Canvas Concur Email Experience Safety Data Sheets Website Settings Search Clear Search Input Search Category Michigan Tech This Site Programs Go Students Resumes and Letters Networking and Interviews Jobs | Co-ops | Internships Start Your Career Path On-Campus Jobs Career Fair Events Employers How to Hire Huskies Partner Program Current Employer Partners Career Fair Faculty/Staff Integrating Career in the Classroom Presentations On-Campus Jobs Career Champions Alumni Career Fair Events Connect Career Services Blog Staff Listing Data Portrait Lounge Search Clear Search Input Search Category Michigan Tech This Site Programs Search Students Resumes and Letters Networking and Interviews Jobs | Co-ops | Internships Start Your Career Path On-Campus Jobs Career Fair Events Employers How to Hire Huskies Partner Program Current Employer Partners Career Fair Faculty/Staff Integrating Career in the Classroom Presentations On-Campus Jobs Career Champions Alumni Career Fair Events Connect Career Services Blog Staff Listing Data Portrait Lounge Connect with Us Request Info Visit Apply Give Resources for You Prospective Students Admitted Students Current Students Faculty and Staff Alumni and Friends Parents and Family Industry and Partners Tech Links A to Z Campus Directory Canvas Concur Email Experience Safety Data Sheets Website Settings Career Services Career Services Connect Data Also in this section Connect Career Services Blog Staff Listing Data First Destination Survey Portrait Lounge Data We want to offer each employer the opportunity to recruit from Michigan Technological\n                           University's dynamic talent pool. This page provides a collection of news, data, and\n                           reports to help you make hiring and recruiting decisions. 92.5% career outcomes for undergraduate and graduate students (2024-25 FDS cycle). 87.8%\n                                 knowledge rate of 2024-25 graduates. $70,720 5 year median starting salary for undergraduate and graduate students (2020-25 FDS\n                                 cycles) 5,113 students & alumni engaged (2025-26 academic year) 498 employers recruiting at Michigan Tech (2025-26 academic year) 60 campus partners (2025-26 academic year) 194 events hosted by Michigan Tech Career Services (2025-26 academic year) Career Outcomes The Career Outcomes dashboard presents an overview of career outcomes within six months\n                                       after graduation. All data is collected through the First Destination Survey (FDS) and follows the standards established by the National Association of Colleges\n                                       and Employers (NACE) to ensure consistency and reliability in reporting. Terminology Career Outcomes – The percentage of graduates who are employed (full- or part-time),\n                                          serving in the military or a volunteer program, or enrolled in continuing education. Knowledge Rate – The percentage of graduates for whom career outcomes information\n                                          is known, either self-reported or obtained through verified third-party sources. Starting Salary – The starting salary as self-reported by graduates through the First\n                                          Destination Survey. Career Outcomes Dashboard If you have additional questions or need access (Michigan Tech Faculty & Staff only)\n                                          please contact Career Services ( career@mtu.edu ). Latest 5 year outcomes and median starting salary information. 2024-25 Co-op Report (hourly pay by major) 2025-2026 Career Fairs Michigan Tech Spring 2026 Vir