    "https://www.mtu.edu/career/connect/portraits/": {
      "title": "Iris Portrait Lounge",
      "description": "Iris Portrait Lounge | Career Services Skip to page content Skip to footer navigation Menu Request Info Visit Apply Give Resources for You Prospective Students Admitted Students Current Students Faculty and Staff Alumni and Friends Parents and Family Industry and Partners Tech Links A to Z Campus Directory Canvas Concur Email Experience Safety Data Sheets Website Settings Search Clear Search Input Search Category Michigan Tech This Site Programs Go Students Resumes and Letters Networking and Interviews Jobs | Co-ops | Internships Start Your Career Path On-Campus Jobs Career Fair Events Employers How to Hire Huskies Partner Program Current Employer Partners Career Fair Faculty/Staff Integrating Career in the Classroom Presentations On-Campus Jobs Career Champions Alumni Career Fair Events Connect Career Services Blog Staff Listing Data Portrait Lounge Search Clear Search Input Search Category Michigan Tech This Site Programs Search Students Resumes and Letters Networking and Interviews Jobs | Co-ops | Internships Start Your Career Path On-Campus Jobs Career Fair Events Employers How to Hire Huskies Partner Program Current Employer Partners Career Fair Faculty/Staff Integrating Career in the Classroom Presentations On-Campus Jobs Career Champions Alumni Career Fair Events Connect Career Services Blog Staff Listing Data Portrait Lounge Connect with Us Request Info Visit Apply Give Resources for You Prospective Students Admitted Students Current Students Faculty and Staff Alumni and Friends Parents and Family Industry and Partners Tech Links A to Z Campus Directory Canvas Concur Email Experience Safety Data Sheets Website Settings Career Services Career Services Connect Portrait Lounge Also in this section Connect Career Services Blog Staff Listing Data Portrait Lounge Iris Portrait Lounge Professional headshots — free, fast, delivered to your inbox. The Iris Portrait Lounge gives Huskies an easy way to capture a polished, professional\n                           headshot for LinkedIn, Handshake, research profiles, Google/gmail accounts, and more.\n                           The booth uses studio‑quality lighting and automated prompts to help you look your\n                           best, no photographer required. Located in Career Services, the booth is open to students, faculty, staff, and alumni.\n                           Sessions take just a few minutes, and your edited photos are delivered straight to\n                           your inbox. Why Get a Professional Headshot? A strong headshot helps you make a confident first impression. Whether you’re connecting\n                           with employers, applying for internships, joining student organizations, or building\n                           your professional brand, a clean, well‑lit photo signals credibility and readiness. Use your headshot for: LinkedIn and Handshake Portfolios and personal websites Email signatures and presentations Research profiles and student org applications How to Use the Iris Portrait Lounge You can use the booth by appointment through Handshake or as a walk‑in during business hours at Career Services. Check in Enter your email address on the touchscreen and follow the on‑screen instructions. Capture your photos The booth will guide you through a series of poses using professional lighting and\n                           a neutral backdrop. Access and edit You’ll receive an email with a link to your photos. Create an Iris account to download,\n                           crop, and lightly edit your images. Share your new headshot Upload it to LinkedIn, Handshake, your website, or anywhere you want to make a strong\n                           first impression. Who Can Use the Booth? The Iris Portrait Lounge is free and available to: Undergraduate and graduate students Faculty and staff Alumni If you need professional clothing for your photo, the Career Closet may be an option. The Career Closet opens twice per year on the weekend before Career Fair . If you have your photo taken while the Career Closet is open, you can choose from\n                           free, gently worn business clothing. Frequently Asked Questions How long does a session take? Most sessions take 3–5 minutes from start to finish. The booth guides you through\n                                       a quick series of poses and sends your photos straight to your email. Do I need an appointment? You can use the booth by appointment through Handshake or as a walk‑in during Career Services hours. Appointments guarantee your time slot;\n                                       walk‑ins are first‑come, first‑served. Where is the Iris Portrait Lounge located? The booth is located inside Career Services (Administration Building, Room 220). Look\n                                       for the Iris Portrait Lounge sign when you enter. How do I get my photos? After your session, you’ll receive an email with a link to your images. Create an\n                                       Iris account to download, crop, and lightly edit your headshots. Is it really free? Yes, headshots taken in the Iris Portrait Lounge are completely free for students,\n                                       faculty, staff, and alumni. What should I wear? Choose something that reflects the professional image you want to project. Solid colors\n                                       photograph well, and layers (like a blazer or sweater) add structure. Request Information Schedule a Visit Give Apply Admissions Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Global Campus Request Information Schedule a Visit Apply Virtual Tours Study and Live Academics Degrees / Majors Library Athletics Campus and Beyond Events Calendar Recreation Campus Info About Michigan Tech Accreditation Campus Map Jobs at Michigan Tech News Summer Youth Programs Webcams Policies and Safety Campus Safety Information Emergency Contact Information Report a Concern Public Safety / Police Services Student Disclosures Title IX University Policies Career Services Administration Building 220 1400 Townsend Drive Houghton, Michigan 49931 906-487-2313 906-487-3317 career@mtu.edu Instagram Linkedin Youtube Accessibility Equal Opportunity Email the Webmaster © 2026 Michigan Technological University ©"
    },
